{"id":"vod_sn_36143","vodId":"36143","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"伊克西翁传说DT","name_cn":"伊克西翁传说DT","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6585251d03bcf32db09a9a5bc2537648.jpg"},"summary":"火风绀（江口拓也 配音）是一个平凡的少年，某一天，绀竟然被召唤到了被称为“米拉”的异世界之中。刚刚来到米拉，绀就发现了被敌方袭击而几乎全军覆没的爱卡尔拉特公主（三上枝织 配音）一行人，此刻，他们正遭到来自于邪恶教团的恐怖组织“因克古尼特”的攻击。在莫名其妙之中，绀打败了队长艾乐库（神谷浩史 配音），解救了公主。作为报酬，公主将带领绀到达都城寻找回到原来世界的方法。　　忠心耿耿的骑士森格伦（中井和哉 配音），能文能武的侍女玛丽安戴尔（福山润 配音），可爱的宠物佩特（细谷佳正 配音），在这些同伴的陪伴下，绀踏上了前往都城的旅程。没想到，一路上危险如影随形，敌人不断骚扰，在这样恶劣的情况下，他们能够顺利到达终点吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FbpvXT77j61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AnE0Seh5i71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/25W6SXKMXB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DQAipyELkv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nRnwFa4N9C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JBGYTympGw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YK8Y4wKyRw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LVqRvit1Ye1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sHyKpkhZjH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pQeCGZnvT51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0cygw4shCE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6LB9LavXrY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UHP1Y6Ds3q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BitWyRFU8m1/video